## Coverage Checklist
- Happy path coverage for each acceptance criterion
- Error and rejection cases for each operation that can fail
- Boundary and edge cases where inputs, counts, sizes, or ordering matter
- Regression cases for known or likely failure modes
- Auth / permission cases if the spec involves roles, tokens, or access rules
- Performance or contract-sensitive cases only if explicitly required by the spec

