## Ambiguities / Gaps
- [AMBIGUOUS: missing expected behavior for ...]

## Constraints
- Every acceptance criterion in spec.md must map to at least one case ID.
- Keep cases behavioral; do not classify them as unit or integration tests.
- Do not invent requirements that are not in the spec.
